<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Strike Warning — Trendupp</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f7;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
        padding: 36px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 36px 40px;
      }
      .body p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        color: #555;
      }
      .body p strong {
        color: #333;
      }
      .warning-box {
        background: #fef3c7;
        border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .warning-box p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #92400e;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .cta {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 32px 0;
      }
      .cta a {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #5b21b6 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 14px 36px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f9f9fb;
        padding: 24px 40px;
        text-align: center;
        border-top: 1px solid #ebebf0;
      }
      .footer p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>⚠️ Strike Warning Notice</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="body">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= firstName || 'there' %></strong>,</p>

        <p>
          We are writing to let you know that a strike has been recorded against your Trendupp Creator account.
        </p>

        <div class="warning-box">
          <p>📊 Current Strike Status: <strong><%= strikesCount %> out of 3 strikes</strong>.</p>
        </div>

        <p>
          Strikes are issued when content submissions are rejected by advertisers due to non-compliance or if accepted campaigns end without content going live.
        </p>

        <p style="color: #b45309; font-weight: 600;">
          IMPORTANT: Receiving 3 strikes from different advertisers will result in your Trendupp account being automatically blocked.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please review your pending campaigns and ensure all drafts and live link submissions follow campaign briefs and guidelines carefully.
        </p>

        <div class="cta">
          <a href="https://trendupp.com/dashboard">View My Campaigns Dashboard</a>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you have any questions or feel this strike was added in error, please reach out to our support team at
          <a href="mailto:support@trendupp.com">support@trendupp.com</a>.
        </p>

        <p>— The Trendupp Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          You are receiving this email because a strike has been registered to your account at
          <strong>trendupp.com</strong>.<br />
          © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Trendupp. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
